# Radio page tour (cold). Demo mode, and the launch default AutoradioDemoSheet = cold (defaults write news.choir.autoradio.lab AutoradioDemoSheet cold),
# which loads fixtures/demo/runsheet-cold.json as the run sheet and keeps the station from starting by itself. @S@ is the shots directory.
clock data
clock +1500 real
clock data
tree
# Cold start: the greeting and the Up next rows are there, nothing is on air yet.
expect radio-greeting
expect radio-play
expect radio-next-list
expect radio-next-0
absent radio-next-empty
absent radio-next
screenshot @S@/A01-cold-start.png window
tap radio-play
clock +3500 real
clock data
tree
# After Play an entry is on air: Next and the speed line draw, the list is still there.
expect radio-next
expect radio-speed
expect radio-next-list
absent radio-next-empty
screenshot @S@/A02-on-air-opening.png window
clock +4000 real
clock data
tree
expect radio-next
expect radio-speed
screenshot @S@/A03-on-air-later.png window
tap radio-play
clock +900 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/A04-paused.png window
